<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oregon Steel Mills cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oregon Steel Mills cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said Wednesday it cut its rating on Oregon Steel Mills Inc to hold from buy after the stock exceeded the price target of $21-1/2 a share.</p>
<p>-- Oregon Steel shares were off 1/8 at 22-1/4.</p>
<p>-- &quot;For investors with costs well below current prices we would emphasize that current business conditions are good at Oregon Steel and the shares should be held,&quot; Dain said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
